Go to your chrome browser and search for ORACLE VIRTUALBOX.
Click on WINDOWS HOSTS for your windows operating system under VIRTUALBOX PLATFORM PACKAGES.
Accept and Download the virtualbox EXTENSION PACK.
Head over to your HOME folder and look for DOWNLOADS in your HOME folder.
Right click or double click on the virtualbox you just downlaoded in order to install then click YES to install.
Incase it does not install then you will need to Download MICROSOFT VISUAL C++ 2019 REDISTRIBUTABLE PACKAGE.
On your chrome browser click on the LATEST SUPPORTED VISUAL C++ REDISTRIBUTABLE DOWNLOADS.
Scroll down  to LATEST SUPPORTED REDISTRIBUTABLE VERSION and download the version that suits your system type.
To find out your system type go to SEARCH on your taskbar and search for SYSTEM INFORMATION then look for system type then you are supposed to see your system type.
Download and install.
Go to your virtualbox and agree to the terms,leave th default settings as they're keep clicking NEXT then click INSTALL and FINISH to complete installation
Now install the extention package to enable all the extra features in virtualbox.
Go on your installed virtualbox and click on TOOLS menu
If you can't find it check your FILE inside virtualbox,then click EXTENSION
Click on the plus + icon usually GREEN in color select the extension pack from your DOWNLOADS FOLDER
Click INSTALL, scroll down and select I AGREE.
THESE ARE THE STEPS TO INSTALL AND SET UP YOUR VIRTUALBOX.
